  {
   "id": "car-service-simulator-326466@0.1.10",
   "gameId": "car-service-simulator-326466",
   "displayName": "Update 0.1.10",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-09-15T16:14:48.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello Mechanics! 🚗🔧",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "With this update, many issues have been fixed and the overall gameplay experience has become smoother. Here are the highlights:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "✨ What’s New in v0.1.10?",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🖥️ UI/UX improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔍 Added the ability to check which operations are completed/not completed on a car by pressing \"I\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45177040/b8cff1f4e85edead5e340a003222ea047caa2690.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "⏸️ Added a “Recover Game” button to the Pause Menu for when the game gets stuck.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45177040/139bba99de74ffa7a3b47067895cb1a63baae57e.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔄 Automatic correction added in case the car flips over.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🚗 Added the ability to press \"T\" if the car gets stuck to move it to a suitable position around the garage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45177040/46c7246ccb11520bcd2330dc1791a7de63cb1827.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "⏱️ Customer agreement waiting time is now shown as UI at the top of the screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "📊 Fixed some indicator position issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🚶 Fixed rare issue when exiting the vehicle.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🛠️ Improved equipment repair speeds.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "💰 Economy improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🤝 Bargaining system improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "📚 Fixed rare UI bug in the tutorial.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "👷 Fixed workers getting stuck after finishing tasks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "📦 Workers now place equipment back on the shelves.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your feedback helps us make the game better every day. Thank you for your support! 🙏",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Join our Discord to stay updated!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45177040/f35188cc267850d5b0d604f311802237c3d6940d.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Don’t forget to check out our other games! 🎮",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3721530/Motorcycle_For_Sale_Simulator/\"][dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2248760/Car_For_Sale_Simulator_2023/\"][dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3393240/Banker_Simulator/\"]",
